# ================================================================ a season of bad air

== bold: a season of bad air / R
base: go out anyway and run your usual route, haze or no haze
likelier_if: mark 'defied an authority' +10; has [campaigning] +5; has [good name in town] +5
- R | chain yourself to the plant gates, and stay there until the police cut you free | v: stimulation, universalism | act: chain themselves to the plant gates, and stay there until the police cut them free | chance: 30 | title: activist in a cause | title_if_fails: someone with a record
works: The chained gates make the evening news, and the plant cuts its night shifts until the air clears. {N} has a cause now, and a place in it.
works: People who never met {N} come to the gates the next morning, and {N} is one of the ones they look to in the campaign against the smoke.
fails: The police cut {N} free and charge {N} with blocking the gates, and the court hands down a record.
fails: The lorries go on rolling, and {N} leaves the court with a conviction and a fine.

